  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong-Australia Partnership on Transnational Crime (MAP-TNC) - Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mekong-Australia Partnership on Transnational Crime Phase 1 aims to build deeper and stronger cooperation between Australian and Mekong government agencies in their battle against transnational crime, specifically illicit drug trafficking, child sexual exploitation and financial crimes. Desired end of program outcome  is that Mekong subregion partners better prevent and counter targeted transnational crimes.  Program enabled originally by Palladium Group and then the MAP-SU (Tetra Tech).</narrative>
  </description>
